# the argument of meno-paradox.md by rule (phil/skeleton): connectives from the parse, an atom to each clause
atom	know_meno_mean	I know Meno what you mean
atom	just_see_tiresome	just see what a tiresome dispute you are introducing
atom	argue_man_enquire	you argue that a man can not enquire about that which he knows or about that which he does not know for if he knows he has no need to enquire
atom	know_subject_enquire	he can for he does not know the very subject about which he is to enquire
P1	S1	know_meno_mean
P2	S1	just_see_tiresome
P3	S2	argue_man_enquire
C	S2	(true -> !know_subject_enquire)
